# Every checkout has the bytes of the index: LF, on Windows too, where
# core.autocrlf would otherwise turn the text files to CRLF and fail the
# tests that read them (the README's ```dart blocks, the skill's front
# matter, the goldens, the SVG shots, the spec files).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Bytes as they are: images, raw pixels, and the fixtures of terminal
# output, whose escapes and line endings are what the tests parse.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.rgba binary
*.bin binary
*.ansi binary
*.diff binary
